OL,3,GNEWSASam Smith support act talks of
OL,4,A'gorgeous' experience
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've been so much more nervous for
OL,7,Fmuch smaller gigs."
OL,9,FPortsmouth musician Bradley Jago was
OL,10,Fone of the 10 acts chosen to support
OL,11,FSam Smith in London and Manchester, as
OL,12,Fpart of the singer's UK-wide talent
OL,13,Fsearch with BBC Introducing.
OL,15,FJago made it through more than 1,500
OL,16,Fsubmissions and said meeting Sam Smith
OL,17,Fhad been "gorgeous and they were just
OL,18,Fexactly who I thought they would be".
OL,20,FHe said stepping on the stage at the
OL,21,FLondon Coliseum, he had felt "calm" and
OL,22,Fit "just felt right".
